<!-- cell: plot id="46a0a8ec-de09-415a-bf2b-498fb9518907" title="The detective hired against Captain Varn (high-level)" edges="c659243d-4bb2-4a2b-b7c9-971b65c7dcac:53282ea0-fb0a-4032-afbe-3f39391978fe>423177bc-595c-461a-bdd8-345dc45a03f6, c9656d01-3e4e-40b6-b554-c2cf930189ce:423177bc-595c-461a-bdd8-345dc45a03f6>cae10e79-3c48-42be-a990-14e688e19e15, 1ae560d0-1e47-430b-88a1-b39082a06f51:cae10e79-3c48-42be-a990-14e688e19e15>10354300-9561-4653-bbbc-809ea3a4b6bc" -->

<ol title="How a detective hired to find dirt on Captain Varn came to take her side, and helped her daughter to the man she trusted.">
<li id="53282ea0-fb0a-4032-afbe-3f39391978fe" timestamp="1">Captain Varn's ex-husband hires a detective to find dirt on her. He finds nothing on her, but sees a politician courting her, and follows him to a company with ties to the mafia.</li>
<li id="423177bc-595c-461a-bdd8-345dc45a03f6" timestamp="2">His client's glee at anything that will hurt Varn troubles him, and he starts looking into the client instead. Watching the politician look after Varn's daughter, he sees a bond forming, and asks Varn to meet him.</li>
<li id="cae10e79-3c48-42be-a990-14e688e19e15" timestamp="3">He finds that Varn is the better parent, and that the father only wants to hurt her. As his own photographs are used against her in court, he cancels the contract and sides with Varn.</li>
<li id="10354300-9561-4653-bbbc-809ea3a4b6bc" timestamp="4">When Varn's ship is destroyed, he helps the politician win custody of her daughter.</li>
</ol>

<!-- cell: plot id="d747aff2-bac6-4448-a95e-2b00d83c5f0d" title="The detective hired against Captain Varn (low-level)" edges="831ce51a-19e7-4614-8a50-c4de9de9fb67:ecfd224a-7ab6-4397-8f49-6fe043e233c1>213dd038-fb32-48ad-90b4-63f3f78e35ac, cb54ba22-e80c-4aef-a96c-ff1294cb90ba:213dd038-fb32-48ad-90b4-63f3f78e35ac>508750bb-0570-4732-a097-ec2d251e25f5, b111f900-09ca-4f24-b8ed-6d338ee254bd:508750bb-0570-4732-a097-ec2d251e25f5>41317c82-ab7b-4df6-8c17-e33939448a3e, 103a36ba-110e-4a00-b6c7-88104477181c:41317c82-ab7b-4df6-8c17-e33939448a3e>b615a6e6-19d5-453f-a3d7-f2e42276d7c3, 155f4eae-86a0-433b-bff2-f7b0bc21869d:b615a6e6-19d5-453f-a3d7-f2e42276d7c3>85c4d4ab-e749-42dd-9451-94eb366ce7bb, b883d1f3-9a7a-493f-b640-8912f8c26cd0:85c4d4ab-e749-42dd-9451-94eb366ce7bb>7ff121b2-0d29-4e9b-b12c-f6e8fc012f89, fceb5632-5ffe-4499-929b-638eba75e5f8:7ff121b2-0d29-4e9b-b12c-f6e8fc012f89>f6d510af-2eb5-46e9-a1aa-2385f1c38b7f, 7e0626ca-cb2b-4048-9e01-85d07c58095a:f6d510af-2eb5-46e9-a1aa-2385f1c38b7f>b1c6a60a-d757-4ad9-a788-c60803b617ad, 4ffc1f56-a07a-4682-8f07-d0ce7e721c86:b1c6a60a-d757-4ad9-a788-c60803b617ad>7e266d4a-1d4d-450e-bcaa-be35b6f5d402, c685f3e7-908e-4928-a445-631665745967:7e266d4a-1d4d-450e-bcaa-be35b6f5d402>d8092fc5-4dea-43a6-a8e1-c68dde5a9d80, 74a974b1-cdd7-4ec9-aa18-9331e1da67bb:d8092fc5-4dea-43a6-a8e1-c68dde5a9d80>edb80954-ecf5-4ec2-8d2a-37bdc28790ff, e55329cf-10bf-4251-bdc3-fa0f41d7ec64:edb80954-ecf5-4ec2-8d2a-37bdc28790ff>1705e003-c8a9-41a9-9ff6-a25d3f36902b, 389e2686-960d-4936-b850-3f643b4fb05b:1705e003-c8a9-41a9-9ff6-a25d3f36902b>b234cb66-d2dc-4a51-978d-fcbbfdb3b796" -->

<ol title="A detective hired by Captain Varn's ex-husband finds nothing on her, is troubled by his client's wish to hurt her, finds that she is the better parent and the father only wants revenge, cancels his contract, and, when her ship is destroyed, helps the politician win custody of her daughter.">
<li id="ecfd224a-7ab6-4397-8f49-6fe043e233c1" timestamp="0.1" location="earth, the detective's office">Captain Varn's ex-husband, who is not over her and wants custody of their daughter, hires the detective to find dirt on her.</li>
<li id="213dd038-fb32-48ad-90b4-63f3f78e35ac" timestamp="0.2" location="earth, a restaurant">Following Varn, the detective watches her dine with a man he recognizes: a politician on the committee that oversees the space agency.</li>
<li id="508750bb-0570-4732-a097-ec2d251e25f5" timestamp="0.3" location="earth, a restaurant">He photographs their meetings, but finds nothing on Varn: she drinks little, talks about her daughter, and goes home alone.</li>
<li id="41317c82-ab7b-4df6-8c17-e33939448a3e" timestamp="1.4" location="earth, the company's offices">Told by his client to dig into the man, he tails the politician to the offices of a mining company known for its ties to the mafia.</li>
<li id="b615a6e6-19d5-453f-a3d7-f2e42276d7c3" timestamp="2.1" location="earth, the detective's office">He hands his client the photographs and the company's name. The man is glad of anything that will hurt Varn, and never once asks about his daughter. For the first time, the detective is uneasy.</li>
<li id="85c4d4ab-e749-42dd-9451-94eb366ce7bb" timestamp="2.2" location="earth, the detective's office">Instead of looking for more on Varn, he starts looking into his client.</li>
<li id="7ff121b2-0d29-4e9b-b12c-f6e8fc012f89" timestamp="2.3" location="earth, Varn's house">Watching Varn's house, he sees the politician spend the day looking after her daughter, and a bond forming between them.</li>
<li id="f6d510af-2eb5-46e9-a1aa-2385f1c38b7f" timestamp="3.1" location="earth, the detective's office">He sends Varn a message on her ship, asking to meet her when she can.</li>
<li id="b1c6a60a-d757-4ad9-a788-c60803b617ad" timestamp="3.2" location="earth, the daughter's school">From the girl's teachers and Varn's neighbours, he learns that Varn has raised her daughter alone, and raised her well.</li>
<li id="7e266d4a-1d4d-450e-bcaa-be35b6f5d402" timestamp="3.3" location="earth, the detective's office">He finds that the father has hardly seen his daughter in years, and has told his friends that the custody case is about making Varn pay.</li>
<li id="d8092fc5-4dea-43a6-a8e1-c68dde5a9d80" timestamp="3.4" location="earth, the court">He sits in on the custody hearing, where the photographs he took are used to paint Varn as the companion of a man tied to the mafia.</li>
<li id="edb80954-ecf5-4ec2-8d2a-37bdc28790ff" timestamp="3.5" location="earth, the detective's office">He cancels his contract with Varn's ex-husband, and sides with Varn.</li>
<li id="1705e003-c8a9-41a9-9ff6-a25d3f36902b" timestamp="4.2" location="earth, the politician's office">He brings the politician what he has found: that Varn is the better parent, and that the father only wants to hurt her.</li>
<li id="b234cb66-d2dc-4a51-978d-fcbbfdb3b796" timestamp="4.5" location="earth, the court">When Varn's ship is destroyed, he puts his evidence before the court for the politician, so that her daughter goes to the man Varn trusted with her, not to her father.</li>
</ol>
